  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">随着国家一系列数字化改革方针政策的出台，智慧园区成为了一个热门技术。智慧园区依托大数据、云计算、物联网等技术，整合了园区建筑、设备、能源、系统等相关资源和数据。今天，<a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/\" target=\"_self\"><strong>古河云科技</strong></a>小编就来给大家说一说数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">智慧园区整体解决方案</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">优势。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生，解锁园区</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“时空机”</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">双渲染，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">1:1还原园区真实世界一层一角、一草一木、一砖一瓦，打破时间与物理空间的界限，实现园区可视全覆盖，真实数据全监测</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">智能四化</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">将园区运营数字化、企业管理信息化、国企协同一体化、办公生活在线化四点</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“智能四化”，打造符合业务逻辑的数据模型，科学构建管理策链，运维成本减少约60%。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">一站整合</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">基于企业服务体系，提供一站式服务窗口，从企业服务到生活服务，全方位提升优质服务，助力园区提高企业影响。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-3/202443155566055.png\" title=\"46\" alt=\"46\" /><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">实现产业资源共享，金融聚合成为产业发展的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“催化剂”，为公众提供衣、食、住、行、购、娱全面周到服务，成为园区服务的“金钥匙”。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">统一运营</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">将数据更好地应用到管理与运用到每一个环节，将项目运行、产业分析、资产盘点等资源形成紧密联系的整体，获得高效、协同、互动的整体效益。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">安全护航</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">智慧园区基于物联网、云计算、大数据和</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">AI等技术，发挥融合优势，构建数字化监控预警调度指挥平台。预制50种以上监测报警策略，秒级侦测告警，即刻联动调度，极速应急处理，实时时间追溯，从事发回溯全流程安全闭环。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-3/202443157555117.png\" title=\"48\" alt=\"48\" /><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">以上就是关于<a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/programme/park.html\" target=\"_self\"><strong>智慧园区</strong></a>的优势了，科技的发展让我们的管理、运用方便快捷，从根本上打破了传统园区管理，提升园区智能化管理和运营，提高了园区整体效率和竞争力。</span></p>",
